    <section class="privacy" id="privacy"><div><span class="eyebrow">A smaller data footprint</span><h2>Feedback, with privacy in mind.</h2></div><div><p>This service asks for no account, email, device identifier or viewing history. It uses no analytics, advertising, tracking cookies or third-party scripts. Only if you explicitly opt in, this browser stores a private review management link in local storage to provide My Reviews; it is accessible to anyone who uses the same browser profile and can be erased at any time. Only published reviews appear in the public list and rating.</p><p>The application does not store raw IP addresses. For spam protection it temporarily stores HMAC-derived address buckets in MySQL, shared across PHP workers. Bucket identifiers change each UTC hour and are not attached to reviews. They expire at the next UTC hour and are removed on the next request or scheduled cleanup. These are short-lived pseudonymous abuse records, not anonymous identities. The host and network providers still receive normal connection information and may have their own logs. This deployment is intended for GoDaddy hosting. The account owner controls the actual hosting logs and backup retention; the PHP service does not disable provider logs or backups. Contact the project maintainer through the linked GitHub project for privacy questions without posting private review links.</p><p>Pending reviews expire after 30 days; expired rows are removed on the next request or hourly scheduled cleanup. Published reviews remain until removed by their author or moderator. Deletion removes the live record; any operator-managed backups follow the operator’s retention policy. Private management links are bearer keys, not verified identities. Forgotten links cannot be recovered without the original key; remembering them is strictly optional. Review authors can update their ratings and text with that link; the previously published version remains visible until an edit is approved. No-account reviews cannot guarantee one vote per person.</p><p><a href="https://github.com/wizdom13/WizeStream" rel="noreferrer">Open-source project ↗</a> · <a href="?view=moderate">Maintainer moderation</a></p></div></section>
